---
import WikiLayout from "../layouts/WikiLayout.astro";
---
<WikiLayout title="Gallery | Underlords Wiki" description="Curated Underlords visual gallery.">
  <section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">GALLERY</div><h1>Visual archive</h1><p class="tagline">Posters, screenshots, server art, films, Tumbleweed, Mafia images, Wall artifacts, and other things worth actually looking at.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section detail-layout">
    <article class="detail-main"><h2>Curated, not dumped</h2><p>This gallery will only publish images with a real story job and clear enough provenance to show them responsibly. The old archive contains thousands of files; that does not mean the wiki needs thousands of thumbnails.</p><div class="wiki-note">First visual targets: the UL icon, Tumbleweed, Banana poster, Halloween work, Wolfie's UL art, selected PR/poster material, and safe reunion visuals. Unrelated screenshots do not get promoted just because they exist.</div></article>
    <aside class="infobox"><div class="infobox-title">Gallery rules</div><dl><div class="row"><dt>Priority</dt><dd>iconic / funny / story-bearing</dd></div><div class="row"><dt>Credit</dt><dd>POSTED BY ≠ MADE BY ≠ CAPTURED BY</dd></div><div class="row"><dt>Default</dt><dd>no image is better than a bad image</dd></div></dl></aside>
  </section>
</WikiLayout>
